{"id": "69643", "title": "婚痒", "author": "奈菲尔", "category": "肉文辣文", "count": 14, "available": 0, "cover": "", "status": "已完成", "source": "files/article/info/69/69643.htm", "intro": "【二句话文案】\r\n你有没有爱过一个人，爱到刻骨铭心，却无从继续？\r\n盛今夏爱章怀远，从暗恋到结婚、离婚， 那么隐忍，又那么骄傲，都是属于她一个人的独幕剧，谢幕后，却又被迫搅合在一起。\r\n\r\n【剧情版】\r\n盛今夏：“章怀远，我们已经离婚了，为什么还是不肯放过我？”\r\n“放你可以，把暮暮留下。”\r\n“---”\r\n盛今夏：“朝朝暮暮都是你的了，你放了我吧。”\r\n“除非，你也是我的。”\r\n“---”\r\n盛今夏：“章怀远，我是你的，我们就可以两清了？”\r\n“你试试。”\r\n“---”\r\n\r\n内容标签：都市情缘 豪门世家 高干", "base": "files/article/html/69/69643", "chapters": [{"title": "1-5", "file": "10668382.html", "available": false}, {"title": "6-10", "file": "10668383.html", "available": false}, {"title": "11-15", "file": "10668384.html", "available": false}, {"title": "16-20", "file": "10668385.html", "available": false}, {"title": "21-25", "file": "10668386.html", "available": false}, {"title": "26-30", "file": "10668387.html", "available": false}, {"title": "31-35", "file": "10668388.html", "available": false}, {"title": "36-40", "file": "10668389.html", "available": false}, {"title": "41-45", "file": "10668390.html", "available": false}, {"title": "46-50", "file": "10668391.html", "available": false}, {"title": "51-55", "file": "10668392.html", "available": false}, {"title": "56-60", "file": "10668393.html", "available": false}, {"title": "61-65", "file": "10668394.html", "available": false}, {"title": "66-70完结", "file": "10668395.html", "available": false}]}